OL,3,ADolly Parton gets new star on Hollywood
OL,4,AWalk of Fame after vandalism
OL,5,
OL,6,FDolly Parton's star on the Hollywood
OL,7,FWalk of Fame has been replaced after
OL,8,Fthe original one was vandalised
OL,9,Ffollowing the late country legend's
OL,10,Fdeath last week.
OL,12,FFans had laid flowers and left candles
OL,13,Faround her star in the heart of
OL,14,FHollywood, Los Angeles, which was
OL,15,Fawarded in 1984.
OL,17,FBut on Monday, photos showed it had
OL,18,Fbeen damaged after vandals scratched
OL,19,Fit, leaving her name badly defaced.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
