OL,3,ADolly Parton gets new star on Hollywood
OL,4,AWalk of Fame after vandalism
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepairs were carried out on Wednesday,
OL,7,Fand the Hollywood Historic Trust said
OL,8,Fthe new star will be unveiled on
OL,9,FFriday.
